    "1 条排队中": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 queued"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 确认电脑上的 DSH 开着、插件已加载；\n2. 手机设置里允许本 App 使用「本地网络」；\n3. 关掉手机上的代理/VPN 再连一次（它会接管 UDP，打洞会失败）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Make sure DSH is running on your computer and the plugin is loaded;\n2. Allow Local Network access for this app in iOS Settings;\n3. Turn off any proxy/VPN on the phone and try again (it takes over UDP, so hole-punching fails)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "6 位配对码": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6-digit pairing code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 内的本地代理只监听 127.0.0.1，但手机上其它 App 可以连上它，而且端口可以由主机 ID 推算出来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The in-app local proxy listens on 127.0.0.1 only, but other apps on this phone can connect to it, and the port is derivable from the host ID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 内的本地代理只监听 127.0.0.1，但手机上其它 App 可以连上它，而且端口能由主机 ID 推算出来。一期如实告知，后续会加进程内握手令牌。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The in-app local proxy listens on 127.0.0.1 only, but other apps on this phone can connect to it, and the port is derivable from the host ID. We tell you now; an in-process handshake token comes later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DSH Pocket": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DSH Pocket"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DSH Pocket 是独立社区项目，与 DeepSeek 官方无隶属关系。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DSH Pocket is an independent community project, not affiliated with DeepSeek."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "unary · session/list": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "unary · session/list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「标识」是别的配置引用这个提供商用的键，建好之后不能改。密钥本身不在这里 —— 这里填的是**环境变量名**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“ID” is the key other settings use to reference this provider — it can’t change after creation. The key itself isn’t here: this field holds the **environment variable name**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一期如实告知；后续可加一个进程内的随机握手令牌（需要电脑端配合）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We say so up front; a random in-process handshake token can be added later (it needs the computer side to cooperate)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次性": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One-shot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
