    "停用后，依赖它的功能会立刻失效。在电脑上重启 DSH 也能恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anything depending on it stops working immediately. Restarting DSH on your computer restores it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停用后，这个包里提供的功能会立刻失效（比如 IM Connect 停掉之后频道会话就不再更新）。在电脑上重启 DSH 也能恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything this bundle provides stops working immediately (disable IM Connect and channel sessions stop updating). Restarting DSH on your computer restores it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先在电脑上的 DSH 里添加一个工作区，然后再来这里新建会话。": {
