    },
    "只在打开开关时才向系统申请通知权限。App 退到后台会断开与电脑的连接（iOS 不允许常驻），所以通知是本地提醒，不是实时推送。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notification permission is requested only when you turn a switch on. The app disconnects from your computer in the background (iOS doesn’t allow persistent connections), so these are local reminders rather than live push."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只影响**之后新建**的会话；已经在跑的会话各自保留自己的模型（那个在会话菜单里改）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affects **new** sessions only; running sessions keep their own model (change that in the session menu)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只能读，不能改文件，也不能跑会写盘的命令。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read only — no file changes, no commands that write."
